    "A plain guide for California families: what a care home's monthly price covers, what Medicare and Medi-Cal pay for, the Assisted Living Waiver, SSI, VA Aid and Attendance, long-term care insurance and free help.": "カリフォルニア州のご家族向けのわかりやすいガイド：ケアホームの月額料金に含まれるもの、Medicare と Medi-Cal が支払うもの、Assisted Living Waiver、SSI、VA の Aid and Attendance、長期介護保険、無料の相談窓口について。",
    "How to Pay for a Care Home in California": "カリフォルニア州でケアホームの費用を支払う方法",
